Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 16:29:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add autonomous SOE XFRM flow offload

Program SOE encryption and decryption flows while preserving OpenWrt PPE ownership rules.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Signed-off-by: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>
[W1700K2_merge 6.18.54 port: function-level 3-way merge onto our airoha_ppe.c.
 G3-base-only behaviour from 930/990-0x/999-9x (eager CDM4 bind, stale-BIND
 invalidation for non-SOE flows, stale-cookie replace, INVALID-slot hash
 fallback, WDMA subflow) is not imported; SOE bind barrier, claim/rollback,
 input-owner and SA flush logic are taken as-is; 961 L2 ingress claim and
 920-xx/950-06 jumbo/ingress fields are kept]
